          "text": "Google sets some of these policies on every new organisation, and an administrator may have set others; an apply that creates a policy that exists stops on 409 POLICY_ALREADY_EXISTS. Run satz adopt once the baseline is on, so every live policy is in the state before the apply; with --import it binds this param itself when it has run.",
          "run": "satz adopt <estate> --execute --import",
          "severity": "error"
